 anlin is a Boone\, NC native who currently makes her home in Asheville\, N
 C.  Maura enjoys performing and collaborating with musicians in a variety 
 of celtic styles:  she performs and tours regularly with duo project Rakis
 h\, with guitarist Conor Hearn\, and has toured and shared the stage with 
 Seamus Egan\, Maeve Gilchrist\, Hanneke Cassel\, and Karan Casey\, among o
 thers.  Maura is a two-time U.S. National Scottish Fiddling Champion\, and
